<title>DENMARK: Copenhagen bourse to hold news conference 0830 GMT.</title>
<headline>Copenhagen bourse to hold news conference 0830 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Copenhagen Stock Exchange on Thursday said it would hold a news conference at 0830 GMT and bourse Chairman Hans Ejvind Hansen said that comment would be forthcoming about a report that his bourse was about to merge its dealing system with that of the Stockholm exchange.</p>
<p>The London Financial Times said on Thursday that the two bourses would announce the deal during the day. Hansen would neither confirm nor deny the report.</p>
</text>
